### Games Reviews
# @name Customer_Reviews_GET
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/catalog/Games(b7e5f1a0-0001-4000-8000-0000000000a1)/reviews?$expand=customer
Authorization: Basic {{username}}:{{password}}


### Game tags
# @name Game_tags_GET
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/catalog/Games(b7e5f1a0-0001-4000-8000-0000000000a6)/tags?$expand=tag
Authorization: Basic {{username}}:{{password}}

### 4. Filter games by tag (expect Neon Circuit Racing, Iron Vanguard, Goal Rush Soccer)
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/catalog/Games?$filter=tags/any(t:t/tag_code eq 'MULTI')&$select=title


